          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લુચ્ચું — luccũ — \"sly; crafty\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તે લુચ્ચો વેપારી બધાને છેતરે છે. te lucco vepārī badhāne chetre che. That sly trader cheats everyone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લુચ્ચું (luccũ) goes back to a reconstructed lucca-, \"defective\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word with the gloss \"lewd\" (CDIAL 11073). Gujarati today uses it for someone sly, and no dictionary we use says how the two senses are linked."
            }
          ]
        },
